<title>GERMANY: Bundesbank details M3 developments in July.</title>
<headline>Bundesbank details M3 developments in July.</headline>
<dateline>FRANKFURT 1997-08-19</dateline>
<text>
<p>The Bundesbank published</p>
<p>the following data relating to M3 money supply in July.</p>
<p>AGGREGATE (in bln marks)	  Jul97  Jun97  Jul96 EndJul</p>
<p>								     Level</p>
<p>1) BANK LENDING TO DOMESTIC</p>
<p>   NON-BANKS (total)	     +28.4  + 9.2  +11.9   4939.7</p>
<p>   Lending by Bundesbank	 +-0.0  +-0.0  +-0.0	8.7</p>
<p>   Lending by banks		+28.4  + 9.2  +11.9   4931.0</p>
<p>    To firms and individuals   + 4.6  +27.0  +11.4   3730.8</p>
<p>of which</p>
<p>     short term lending	  -17.8  +18.4  -13.5    605.7</p>
<p>    To public authorities	+23.8  -17.8   +0.5   1200.2</p>
<p>2) NET EXTERNAL ASSETS</p>
<p>OF CREDIT INSTITUTIONS</p>
<p>   AND THE BUNDESBANK	    + 7.1  +17.0  + 1.0    282.5</p>
<p>3) MONETARY CAPITAL FORMATION</p>
<p>   FROM DOMESTIC SOURCES, TOTAL+15.4  +12.8  + 5.8   2854.6</p>
<p>of which</p>
<p>Time deposits</p>
<p>     4 yrs and more		 +3.5   +0.7   +7.4   821.8</p>
<p>Savings deposits over 3 mths</p>
<p>   notice, savings certificates -1.4   -1.2   -2.1   490.5</p>
<p>Bank debt securities</p>
<p>     in circulation		 +8.5  + 7.0   -0.8  1186.3</p>
<p>4) DEPOSITS OF FED. GOVT.</p>
<p>   IN BANKING SYSTEM		-1.0   +0.9   -0.0     0.1</p>
<p>5) OTHER FACTORS		   +25.9  +12.5  + 7.6   221.3</p>
<p>6) MONEY STOCK M3		  -4.8   + 0.1  - 0.5  2146.2</p>
<p> Currency in circulation	 +1.0   - 0.6   +0.7   246.6</p>
<p>    Sight deposits		 -4.7   +14.2   -3.2   623.5</p>
<p>    Time deposits up to 4 yrs  -1.3   -13.0   -1.6   385.2</p>
<p>Savings deposits at</p>
<p>     three months notice	 +0.1    -0.4   +3.6   890.9</p>
<p>SEASONALLY ADJUSTED DATA</p>
<p> Annual change from Q4 1996(%) +5.7    +6.4    -    2154.9</p>
<p>Money M3, monthly average</p>
<p>Annual change over past</p>
<p>six months (%)</p>
<p>   M3 aggregate		    +3.8    +6.4    -	-</p>
<p>   M2 aggregate		    +2.5    +2.6    -    1274.9</p>
<p>   M1 aggregate		    +8.0    +6.8    -     888.1</p>
<p>   M3 extended			-	+4.9    -	-</p>
<p>Lending to firms</p>
<p>    and individuals		+7.0    +7.2    -    3738.8</p>
<p>   Monetary capital formation  +5.5    +4.3    -    2852.2</p>
<p>--Frankfurt Newsroom +49 69 756525</p>
</text>
